WEBVTT

00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:14,820
Is it better to take Fitment as a four days in a row or to skip a day for the week?

00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:24,620
Good question. Now the truth is the original from Joe Tipin's protocol was three days on four days off and it was three days in a row.

00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:33,320
But since that it's been literally all over the board. There are people that just do it every other day period. They just do it every other day.

00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:38,120
I tend to think to do it four days in a row or better.

00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:48,120
Now I could be totally wrong when somebody else could get on say, I have done it. No, I think it's what my cancer and remission it. I've done it every other day.

00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:53,600
You know, then everybody's literally across the board with this. There's some people that do it every single day.

00:00:54,120 --> 00:01:01,760
There's some people that just do it one day a week. It's just literally all over the board. I tend to think I'm coaching you. I'd say do it four days in a row.

